<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23744" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειπν-έω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					1084
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.3.35
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					11.9
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.6
			</span></i>: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδείπνησα,</span>
			
				Ep.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείπνησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.111
				</span></i>
			, etc.: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδείπνηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					1133
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				Att.
			
			1pl.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδείπναμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					109
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				91
			</span></i>; inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδειπνάναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					464
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				249
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				144
			</span></i>: plpf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδεδειπνήκεσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					1.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				Ep.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδειπνήκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.359
				</span></i>
			:—<i>make a meal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖπνον</span>): in 
				Att.
			 always, <i>take the chief meal, dine,</i> once in
			Trag., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειπνεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					894
				</span></i>
			 (dub. l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὸ ἄριστον</span>
			<i>make</i> breakfast <i>serve as dinner,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.2.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. παρά τινι</span>
			<i>with</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				1.18
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πρυτανείῳ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἄρτον</span>
			<i>make a meal on</i> bread, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				442
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. μοσχίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ephipp.
					15.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοτύλην μίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					221.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξίφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mnesim.
					7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τἀλλότρια,</span> of
			parasites, freq. in Com., Theopom<i><span class="en">
				p.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				72
			</span></i>, etc.; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					890
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>entertain,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Milet.</u>
					7.68
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Cos</u>
				131
			</span></i>.</div>
